hy section"},{"citationTitle":"《元史·睿宗传》","url":"http://www.guoxue.com/shibu/24shi/yuanshi/yuas_115.htm","type":"reference-link","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"世祖本纪三","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"元史·世祖本纪三","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"《元史·世祖本纪三》","url":"http://www.guoxue.com/shibu/24shi/yuanshi/yuas_006.htm","type":"reference-link","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"新元史","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"世祖本纪二","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"新元史·世祖本纪二","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"《新元史·世祖本纪二》","url":"http://www.guoxue123.com/shibu/0101/00xys/007.htm","type":"reference-link","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"元史·祭祀三·宗庙上","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"《元史·祭祀三·宗庙上》","url":"http://www.guoxue.com/shibu/24shi/yuanshi/yuas_074.htm","type":"reference-link","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"睿宗皇帝加上尊谥册文","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"国朝文类","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"册文","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"新元史·拖雷传","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:37:05.327Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:yuanshi"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-94d492ab28186e26","query":"拖雷","count":5,"offset":8406,"excerpt":"八年癸酉春，耶律留哥自立為遼王，改元元統。\n\n秋七月，克宣德府，遂攻德興府。皇子拖雷、駙馬赤駒先登，拔之。帝進至懷來。及金行省完顏綱、元帥高琪戰，敗之，追至北口。金兵保居庸，詔可忒、薄剎守之。遂趨涿鹿。金西京留守忽沙虎遁去。帝出紫荊關，敗金師于","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-d56430f1e43d850b","query":"拖雷","count":7,"offset":110,"excerpt":"略地之功居多。太祖崩，自霍博之地來會喪。\n\n元年己丑夏，至忽魯班雪不只之地。皇弟拖雷來見。\n\n秋八月己未，諸王百官大會于怯綠連河曲雕阿蘭之地，以太祖遺詔即皇帝位于庫鐵烏阿剌里。始立朝儀，皇族尊屬皆拜。頒大札撤。〔華言大法令也。〕金遣阿虎帶來歸太","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-62ec7580490d37b5","query":"拖雷","count":1,"offset":34,"excerpt":"〔篇題：本紀第三〕\n〔編者說明：憲宗〕\n\n憲宗桓肅皇帝，諱蒙哥，睿宗拖雷之長子也。母曰莊（獻）〔聖〕太后，〔莊（獻）〔聖〕太后　本證云：「案后妃表，至元二年追諡莊聖皇后，至大三年加諡顯懿莊聖皇后，后妃傳同，此誤。」按「獻」誤，今改。","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-27210725293efac4","query":"拖雷","count":1,"offset":3021,"excerpt":"王\n\n　\n\n　\n\n太祖皇帝，六子：長朮赤太子；次二察合台太子；次三太宗皇帝；次四拖雷，即睿宗也；次五兀魯赤，無嗣；次六闊列堅太子。\n\n朮赤太子位\n\n朮赤\n\n拔都大王\n\n　\n\n　\n\n　\n\n　\n\n　\n\n撒里答大王\n\n　\n\n　\n\n　\n\n　\n\n忙哥帖木","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-ce62ef33fa53f8a7","query":"拖雷","count":22,"offset":42,"excerpt":"題：列傳第二〕\n〔編者說明：睿宗　裕宗　顯宗　順宗〕\n\n睿宗\n\n睿宗景襄皇帝，諱拖雷，太祖第四子，太宗母弟也。方太祖崩時，太宗留霍博之地，國事無所屬，拖雷實身任之。聞燕京盜賊白晝剽掠富民財物，吏不能禁，遂遣塔察、吾圖撒合里往窮治之，殺十有六人，","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-8e3a2fb0e77fb550","query":"拖雷","count":1,"offset":2232,"excerpt":"卷一三三脫歡傳所見「皇子闊出、忽都禿」補。本書卷一０七宗室世系表作「忽覩都」，係拖雷次子。〕行省鐵木答兒定河南，累有戰功。\n\n憲宗之伐宋也，世祖以皇弟受命攻鄂。大駕征西川，遣元帥兀良哈台自交趾擣宋，與諸軍合。歲己未，皇弟駐兵鄂渚，聞兀良哈台由廣","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-4fbd0ae6c82818c0","query":"拖雷","count":1,"offset":2207,"excerpt":"辛亥睿宗以石剌為國宣力者三代　據本書卷二太宗紀四年壬辰歲九月條及卷一一五睿宗傳，拖雷死於壬辰。又按本書卷三憲宗紀，辛亥為憲宗即位之年，上距睿宗死已十九年。「睿」當為「憲」之誤。新編已校。〕命益金更造所佩虎符賜之，佐諸王也苦及扎剌台控制高麗。己未","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-b592103af7702715","query":"拖雷","count":1,"offset":7045,"excerpt":"以功奏，遷金紫光祿大夫、都元帥，鎮戍邊隅，數與金人戰，未嘗敗北。\n\n壬辰，皇太弟拖雷南渡河，天祿為前鋒，戰退金兵，奪戰船數艘。夜至歸德城下，襲其營，殺三百餘人。金將陳防禦出兵追圍天祿，天祿潰圍復戰，金兵退走。提兵掠亳及徐，所過望風附降。癸巳秋九","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-1bd09c7477792285","query":"拖雷","count":1,"offset":104,"excerpt":"字顯卿。其先陳留人，後徙大名。父善，登金進士第。歲壬辰，國兵下河南，善以策干太弟拖雷，命為必闍赤。\n\n立道年十七，以父任備宿衞。世祖即位，立道從北征，未嘗去左右。至元四年，命立道使西夏，給所部軍儲，以幹敏稱。皇子忽哥赤封雲南王，往鎮其地，詔以立","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":9,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:yuanshi-94d492ab28186e26","bookId":"book:yuanshi","requestedTitle":"元史/卷001","title":"元史/卷001","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%85%83%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7001","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2259382","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%85%83%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7001?action=history","revisionId":2259382,"revisionTimestamp":"2023-02-04T08:42:14Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:57:08.330Z","sha256":"10698700e5fb3ce190f79bfc84a181d878daf5be3196b4af882ce7f1852eb3f5","textSha256":"9a5755c9b10846ce19f60a1bcf570072b3ce4d1ff9f8bef0a302ea8ff529b630","expandedWikitextSha256":"10698700e5fb3ce190f79bfc84a181d878daf5be3196b4af882ce7f1852eb3f5","characters":12259,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/yuanshi.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:41.627Z","upstreamTextQuality":50,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":["Textquality 50% 是維基文庫平台品質標記，不代表正文已轉錄比例。"],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/